P means our reaction coordinate is periodic ( i.e. 0 o = 360 o ) -1 181 61 0.01 means generate a PMF from -1 to 181 degrees
 using 61 bins with a tolerance for reconstructing the PMF of 0.01 (kcal?) 300 = assume 300 K 0 = do not pad data points. meta.dat = meta file (input to WHAM) result.dat = the output file.
